sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant B as Browser (Assistant page)
  participant A as API: POST /chat/stream
  participant R as Assistant service
  participant O as Ollama
  participant D as SQL database
  B->>A: question + JWT
  A->>A: check role, rate limit (12 per minute), conversation owner
  A->>R: answer_question_stream
  R->>D: hybrid search over this user's documents
  R->>R: evidence gate, sanitise, drop injection-like text, label E1 to E5
  A-->>B: event meta (retrieval mode, excluded count)
  alt nothing passes the gate
    R-->>A: final = not enough evidence (model never called)
  else evidence found
    R->>O: system prompt + question + evidence (JSON mode, streaming)
    loop pieces of JSON arrive
      O-->>R: a small piece of text
      R->>R: hold the answer text back until supported is true and a valid citation was seen
      R-->>A: citations, then delta text
      A-->>B: event citations, then event delta
    end
    R->>R: final check: strict JSON, supported, citations map to retrieved chunks
  end
  A->>D: save the user and assistant messages, write the audit row
  A-->>B: event done (the saved message replaces the streamed text)
  Note over B,A: If the browser presses Stop or disconnects before done, nothing is saved
